{"3965470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "WOLF-FLOW", "steam_appid": 3965470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>WOLF-FLOW</i> marks the beginning of a new era of psychological battles, brought to you by KAZU, the developer of <i>Jinro no Rougoku Akumu (Werewolf Prison Nightmare)</i>.<br>This is a command-based online Werewolf game you can play without speaking a single word.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed as a party game, it’s best enjoyed with friends online using voice chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965470/extras/f69fa8092e898b031d9d3f2f4af25fae.poster.avif?t=1783917750\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965470/extras/f69fa8092e898b031d9d3f2f4af25fae.webm?t=1783917750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965470/extras/f69fa8092e898b031d9d3f2f4af25fae.mp4?t=1783917750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965470/extras/9cf85c8a6942ad49cdcc9bfbf55bcb7c.poster.avif?t=1783917750\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965470/extras/9cf85c8a6942ad49cdcc9bfbf55bcb7c.webm?t=1783917750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965470/extras/9cf85c8a6942ad49cdcc9bfbf55bcb7c.mp4?t=1783917750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy and accessible command battles:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need for the complicated debates of traditional Werewolf. With intuitive command selection, anyone can casually enjoy the mind games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avatar performances by popular voice actors:</strong><br>Famous voice actors breathe life into the characters, turning discussions into a dramatic experience. Avatars’ expressions and motions reveal both lies and truths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965470/extras/7b0c528cead23b9d1abd51504f19d08b.avif?t=1783917750\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965470/extras_big/7b0c528cead23b9d1abd51504f19d08b.avif?t=1783917750 width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free avatar customization:</strong><br>Mix and match parts such as face, hairstyle, and clothing to create your own original avatar. Step onto the stage of debate with your unique style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965470/extras/6313eede4069ece2f9faf35893c2876d.poster.avif?t=1783917750\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965470/extras/6313eede4069ece2f9faf35893c2876d.webm?t=1783917750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965470/extras/6313eede4069ece2f9faf35893c2876d.mp4?t=1783917750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since <i>WOLF-FLOW</i> is an Early Access title, it will still be in development at launch. You may encounter bugs, unfinished features, or performance issues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We also plan to add collaboration skins, emotes, and more in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us in Early Access and help shape the future of <i>WOLF-FLOW</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965470/extras/12fc335565a4a1262239bb22fd114d75.poster.avif?t=1783917750\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965470/extras/12fc335565a4a1262239bb22fd114d75.webm?t=1783917750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965470/extras/12fc335565a4a1262239bb22fd114d75.mp4?t=1783917750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>WOLF-FLOW</i> marks the beginning of a new era of psychological battles, brought to you by KAZU, the developer of <i>Jinro no Rougoku Akumu (Werewolf Prison Nightmare)</i>.<br>This is a command-based online Werewolf game you can play without speaking a single word.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed as a party game, it’s best enjoyed with friends online using voice chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965470/extras/f69fa8092e898b031d9d3f2f4af25fae.poster.avif?t=1783917750\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965470/extras/f69fa809