"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free avatar customization:</strong><br>Mix and match parts such as face, hairstyle, and clothing to create your own original avatar. Step onto the stage of debate with your unique style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965470/extras/6313eede4069ece2f9faf35893c2876d.poster.avif?t=1783917750\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965470/extras/6313eede4069ece2f9faf35893c2876d.webm?t=1783917750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965470/extras/6313eede4069ece2f9faf35893c2876d.mp4?t=1783917750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since <i>WOLF-FLOW</i> is an Early Access title, it will still be in development at launch. You may encounter bugs, unfinished features, or performance issues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We also plan to add collaboration skins, emotes, and more in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us in Early Access and help shape the future of <i>WOLF-FLOW</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965470/extras/12fc335565a4a1262239bb22fd114d75.poster.avif?t=1783917750\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965470/extras/12fc335565a4a1262239bb22fd114d75.webm?t=1783917750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965470/extras/12fc335565a4a1262239bb22fd114d75.mp4?t=1783917750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "&quot;WOLF-FLOW&quot; is a next-generation, command-based Werewolf game. Use commands like “Argue” and “Trust” to outsmart your opponents! Customize your avatar to express your unique style, lead your team to victory, and aim for MVP!", "supported_languages": "Japanese<strong>*</strong>, English<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965470/566b0dc00918ac25a52ef8913226cb70714be2fa/header.jpg?t=1783917750", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965470/1b297ebc5daa542ff91b6917cfd65b3875ec50ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783917750", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965470/1b297ebc5daa542ff91b6917cfd65b3875ec50ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783917750", "website": "https://wlfproject.com/wolf-flow", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-BIT 必須)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-7500 / AMD Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX1060 (VRAM 6GB) / Radeon RX 580 (VRAM 4GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> ・負荷の大きい場面ではフレームレートが低下する場合があります。・アップデート分のストレージについては追加で必要になります。</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64bit必須)/Windows 11 (64bit必須)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i7 8700 / AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX2070 / Radeon RX 5700XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 1